+# Rental module: equipment, quote and book
+
+Added `createRentalService()` in `src/index.ts` (in-memory): `addEquipment`, `quote`, `book`.
+Tests in `test/rental.test.ts` (written first, run with `npm test`). Cancellation is deliberately not
+implemented; the 24-hour refund rule is left for a later task. See the decision-log for conventions.
